          message: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 x\xF3a ph\u1EA7n thi khi b\xE0i thi \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 l\u01B0\u1EE3t l\xE0m b\xE0i c\u1EE7a h\u1ECDc vi\xEAn."
