          message: "C\xE2u h\u1ECFi n\u1ED1i \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 2 c\xE2u h\u1ECFi v\xE0 2 l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn",
